Print(Concat('Kurtosis (excess): ', ToString(DoeLibrary.Kurtosis(measurements)), ' (0 = normal-like tails)'));`}]},{name:"Financial",icon:X(Nr),snippets:[{name:"Time Value of Money",description:"Fv, Pv, Pmt, Nper, Rate for a simple loan",code:`// Financial: time value of money for a $10,000 loan, 60 months at 0.5%/month
