Print(Concat('Straight-line interest estimate, period 1: ', ToString(straightLineInterest)));`},{name:"Depreciation Methods",description:"Compare straight-line, SYD, and declining-balance depreciation",code:`// Financial: compare depreciation methods for a $10,000 asset, $1,000 salvage, 5-year life
