Print(Concat('XIRR: ', ToString(irr)));`},{name:"Bond & T-Bill Pricing",description:"Disc, Intrate, Received, Pricedisc, Tbillprice, TbillYield, Tbilleq",code:`// Financial: bond and T-bill pricing between a settlement and maturity date
