Print(Concat('Bond-equivalent yield (Tbilleq): ', ToString(tbillEquivalent)));`},{name:"Fractional Price Conversion",description:"Convert between fractional and decimal price quotes (e.g. bond ticks)",code:`// Financial: convert between fractional and decimal price quotes (e.g. bond ticks)
